<title>CHINA: Trading of CCT Telecom shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading of CCT Telecom shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of telecommunications equipment maker CCT Telecom Holdings Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Monday.  </p>
<p>The company's shares gained HK$0.02 to close at HK$0.80 per share on Friday on volume of 267.43 million shares.</p>
<p>Last month, CCT Telecom said it would place 12.51 percent of its enlarged share capital to a commercial arm of China's Xinhua News Agency at HK$0.42 each.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
